{"id":"cc787cdf3049271e","group":"89","path":"89/89-prop-glb-glp-embedding.md","title":"Syntactic Embedding of GLB into GLP","display":"prop-glb-glp-embedding — Syntactic Embedding of GLB into GLP","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-prop-glb-glp-embedding","aliases":["89-prop-glb-glp-embedding"],"display":"prop-glb-glp-embedding — Syntactic Embedding of GLB into GLP","depends_on":["[[89-df-glb-logic]]","[[89-df-glp-logic]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-prop-glb-glp-embedding"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-prop-glb-glp-embedding</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-glb-glp-embedding — Syntactic Embedding of GLB into GLP"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5a9efa2261b8f73c\" href=\"?note=5a9efa2261b8f73c\" title=\"89-df-glb-logic\">89-df-glb-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5518caddec83ace1\" href=\"?note=5518caddec83ace1\" title=\"89-df-glp-logic\">89-df-glp-logic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GLB}\">\\(\\mathrm{GLB}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GLP}\">\\(\\mathrm{GLP}\\)</span> 分别取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5a9efa2261b8f73c\" href=\"?note=5a9efa2261b8f73c\" title=\"89-df-glb-logic\">89-df-glb-logic</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5518caddec83ace1\" href=\"?note=5518caddec83ace1\" title=\"89-df-glp-logic\">89-df-glp-logic</a> 的定理集。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota:\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_P\">\\(\\iota:\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_P\\)</span> 是结构递归映射：保持字母、底、布尔构造，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota(\\Box_iA)=[i]\\iota(A)\">\\(\\iota(\\Box_iA)=[i]\\iota(A)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i=0,1\">\\(i=0,1\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}glb\\text{-}glp\\text{-}embedding}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\\n(A\\in\\mathrm{GLB}\\Longrightarrow\\iota(A)\\in\\mathrm{GLP}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}glb\\text{-}glp\\text{-}embedding}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\\n(A\\in\\mathrm{GLB}\\Longrightarrow\\iota(A)\\in\\mathrm{GLP}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 15 章 p.207 的 GLP 定义（直接句法推论）。印刷页 p 对应 PDF 第 p+39 页。</p>\n<p>重言式、两个 K/L 模式以及 GLB 的两个交互模式，翻译后分别是 GLP 的对应实例（交互取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=0\">\\(n=0\\)</span>）。MP 与第一盒必然化也被 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 保持，故对有限 GLB 推导归纳。</p>\n<p>本条只断言从 GLB 到 GLP 的定理保持；原书此页没有在这里展开反方向的保守性证明，本目录也不把该单向结论改写成未经论证的双向等价。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-glb-logic","status":"resolved","id":"5a9efa2261b8f73c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-glb-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-glp-logic","status":"resolved","id":"5518caddec83ace1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-glp-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-glb-logic","status":"resolved","id":"5a9efa2261b8f73c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GLB}$ 与 $\\mathrm{GLP}$ 分别取 [[89-df-glb-logic]]、[[89-df-glp-logic]] 的定理集。","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-glp-logic","status":"resolved","id":"5518caddec83ace1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GLB}$ 与 $\\mathrm{GLP}$ 分别取 [[89-df-glb-logic]]、[[89-df-glp-logic]] 的定理集。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{GLB}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GLP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota:\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_P","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota(\\Box_iA)=[i]\\iota(A)","display":false},{"tex":"i=0,1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}glb\\text{-}glp\\text{-}embedding}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\\n(A\\in\\mathrm{GLB}\\Longrightarrow\\iota(A)\\in\\mathrm{GLP}).","display":true},{"tex":"n=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota","display":false}],"bytes":1419,"backlinks":[{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-101","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-prop-glb-glp-embedding]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-165","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"GLP（p.207）：[[89-df-polymodal-formula]] → [[89-df-glp-logic]] → [[89-df-glsp-logic]] → [[89-lem-glp-finite-support]]；与 GLB 的连接见 [[89-prop-glb-glp-embedding]]。"}],"outgoing":["5a9efa2261b8f73c","5518caddec83ace1"]}